  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated multi-sectoral response for conflict affected community in Kondala district of West Wollega zone of Oromia regional state, Ethiopia.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtIn light of the severe conflict in the West Wollega zone, Oromia regional states and observed high needs for multi-sectoral responses by the people in the area, this project will provide a multi-sectoral emergency responsenbspto the conflict affected people through support of shelter and drinking water, children with educational supports. The project will build on the lessons and practices ofnbspexisting structures and their responsesnbspto such an event in Kondala district of West Wollega zone of Oromia region. This mechanism will provide an opportunity for local partner tonbspbe part of the response interventions through the project period. The intervention will also provide a platform for the local community structure and government partners to take part in the implementation of the project to realize the intended objectives.nbsplt/pgt</narrative>
  </description>
